WEBVTT

00:05:27.782 --> 00:05:30.951
diabetes and heart disease

00:05:30.993 --> 00:05:34.080
have been linked to trauma
and chronic stress.

00:05:35.331 --> 00:05:39.168
But it's the psychic pain
that affects people the most.

00:05:39.835 --> 00:05:44.215
Depression, PTSD
and other psychiatric disorders

00:05:44.256 --> 00:05:48.677
affect a significant percentage
of people who go through war.

00:05:49.261 --> 00:05:53.265
I was shocked when I learned
that since 9/11,

00:05:53.265 --> 00:05:57.686
four times more US soldiers
have taken their own lives

00:05:57.728 --> 00:05:59.855
than died in combat.